				<section class="has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-affe4e0 elementor-section-full_width elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-eae-slider="17655" data-id="affe4e0" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-410f792" data-eae-slider="1044" data-id="410f792" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0b97db6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="0b97db6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Rentals</div>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2614a22 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2614a22" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Our historic building is a beautiful and versatile indoor/outdoor event space for the performing arts. An open auditorium with a capacity of up to 300 guests, featuring a proscenium stage. We prioritize arts-focused events.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d439c23 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="d439c23" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><strong>Rentable Spaces: </strong></p><ul style="column-count: 3;"><li>Main Theater</li><li>Kitchen</li><li>Patio/Balcony</li><li>Dressing Rooms (2)</li><li>Classroom</li><li>Outdoor Stage</li><li>Private Lot</li></ul>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-dff5419 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="dff5419" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><strong>Amenities:</strong></p><ul><li>Private parking for 17 vehicles</li><li>State-of-the-art D&amp;B technical equipment available for both indoor and outdoor use</li><li>WIFI access</li><li>In- house Bar</li></ul>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-fed9231 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="fed9231" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><strong>Requirements:</strong></p><ul><li>An additional fee applies for chair setup &amp; table rentals.</li><li>Any additions not outlined in the rental agreement during or after the event will incur extra charges.</li><li>Renters are financially responsible for any damage to the property or equipment.</li><li>All events must last a minimum of 5 hours.</li><li>Cerificate Insurance for all Events</li></ul>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-850673b elementor-align-left elementor-mobile-align-center elementor-button-info elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="850673b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
					<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm elementor-animation-grow" href="https://app.perfectvenue.com/venues/ruth-williams-opera-house/hello" target="_blank">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">INQUIRE NOW</span>
					</span>
					</a>
				</div>
								</div>
