					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1182" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="2" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1182"><p><b>Base Rate Outdoor Theater: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$550.00</span></p><p><b>Base Rate Main Theater: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$900.00</span></p><p><b>Dressing Room: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$200.00</span></p><p><b>Kitchen: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$450.00<br /></span><em><span style="font-weight: 400;">Full Prep Kitchen, no cooking allowed</span></em></p><p><b>Basic Lighting System : </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$200.00</span></p><p><b>Cable ramps 150&#8242; ft Cable ramps: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$300.00</span></p><p><b>Classroom Rental: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$200.00</span></p><p><b>Lighting System: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$300.00</span></p><p><b>Dolby Wireless Speaker with Accessories: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$400.00</span></p><p><b>Eaw Speaker Monitors System Passive Speakers: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$65.00 Per Item</span></p><p><b>External Power inside: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$300.00</span></p><p><em><span style="font-weight: 400;">Cam services, 3 distribution boxes, 50-amp cables and adaptors, 100&#8242; power cords, 50&#8242; power cables, adaptors, and connectors to power outside of the building or provide</span></em></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Generator:</strong> $800.00</span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Delivery &#8211; 10,000 Watt Generator &#8211; Silent:</strong> $500.00</span></p><p><strong>Microphone Kit With Accessories:</strong> <span style="font-weight: 400;">$450.00</span></p><p><em><span style="font-weight: 400;">5 SM58 MICS4 SM57 </span></em></p><p><b>Mackie Sound System: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$300.00</span></p><p><b>Main Sound System indoors: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$200.00 </span></p><p><b>Medium Sound System: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$125.00<br /></span><em><span style="font-weight: 400;">Includes main PA and 4 wireless mics and Aux input</span></em></p><p><b>Outdoor Large Sound System: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$650.00</span></p><p><b>Parking Lot: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$250.00</span></p><p><b>Projection System: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$950+<br /></span><em><span style="font-weight: 400;">Rates may vary depending on tech needs </span></em></p><p><b>Recording Equipment: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$350.00<br /></span><em><span style="font-weight: 400;">Multitrack recorder and Laptop (Podcast recording gear)</span></em></p><p><b>Small Sound System: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$50.00 per item</span></p><p><b>Stage and Shade: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$2,500.00<br /></span><em><span style="font-weight: 400;">24×16 stage and shade</span></em></p><p><b>Static Lighting System:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> $100.00</span></p><p><strong>ULX Shure Wireless Mic Rack:</strong> <span style="font-weight: 400;">$500.00<br /></span><em>4 Wireless Mics Kit Transmiters, 4 HH</em></p><p><b>Mixing console M32 Midas and stage box: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$350.00<br /></span><em><span style="font-weight: 400;">32-channel mixing board and stage box 16 outputs</span></em></p><p><b>Outdoor lighting system: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$2,550.00<br /></span><em><span style="font-weight: 400;">Stage lighting and Decorations</span></em></p><p><b>Cleaning Fee</b> <b>Indoors: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$350</span></p><p><b>Cleaning Fee Outdoors: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">$700</span></p></div>
